id: pm-w91mvg
title: "GH-773: install portable merge drivers without permanent checkout-path drift"
description: "Repositories installing pm from a devDependency persist checkout-specific dist paths in clone-local Git driver config, and health then reports permanent drift or recommends a reinstall loop that reduces portability."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
