author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Merge-driver installation records a stable executable strategy appropriate to the package source; Health compares semantic driver identity without accepting stale or unsafe executables; DevDependency global install and packed-consumer clones pass portability tests; Remediation converges in one run
goal: project management = context management
objective: Make field-aware PM merges dependable across clones worktrees and package layouts
value: Parallel agents retain semantic merge safety without host-specific configuration drift
parent: pm-o2kc
risk: high
confidence: high
resolution: "Implemented portable, package-identity-verified merge-driver recognition with defensive command parsing and unrelated-consumer proof."
expected_result: A merge driver installed from a packed/global pm package remains healthy when the original checkout path changes.
actual_result: Driver validation recognizes the exact installed @unbrained/pm-cli binary through its package manifest while rejecting lookalike commands and paths.
